  "body": "## Summary\n\nPassing a zero-weight split leg into `VotingEscrow.multiSplit` will cause a denial-of-service for withdrawing users as any gHYBR holder will invoke `withdraw` with a full exit\n\n## Root Cause\nIn GovernanceHYBR.sol:190 the computed `remainingAmount` can be zero when a user exits their entire position (or fee rounds to zero) and `VotingEscrow.multiSplit` enforces every split weight to be strictly positive, so the contract forwards `[remainingAmount, userAmount, feeAmount]` with a zero element and reverts with `\"ZW\"`\n\n\n1. User deposits HYBR and receives gHYBR shares via `GovernanceHYBR.deposit`, locking funds in the shared veNFT\n2. User calls `GovernanceHYBR.withdraw` with all their shares\n```solidity\nuint256 remainingAmount = veBalance - userAmount - feeAmount;\nrequire(remainingAmount >= 0, \"Cannot withdraw entire veNFT\");\nuint256[] memory amounts = new uint256[](3);\namounts[0] = remainingAmount;\namounts[1] = userAmount;\namounts[2] = feeAmount;\nIVotingEscrow(votingEscrow).multiSplit(veTokenId, amounts);\n```\n3. `remainingAmount` (or `feeAmount`) is zero, so `VotingEscrow.multiSplit` rejects the call\n```solidity\nfor (uint i = 0; i < amounts.length; i++) {\n    require(amounts[i] > 0, \"ZW\");\n}\n```\n4. The revert propagates and the withdrawal fails, leaving the user unable to exit their position\n\n## impact\nLegitimate users cannot withdraw their locked HYBR when their remainder or fee share is zero, causing a self-DoS on exits\n\n## Mitigation\nGuard the `amounts` passed to `multiSplit` so every leg is strictly positive. For example:\n```solidity\nuint256[] memory split;\nif (feeAmount == 0) {\n    split = new uint256[](2);\n    split[0] = remainingAmount;\n    split[1] = userAmount;\n} else if (remainingAmount == 0) {\n    split = new uint256[](2);\n    split[0] = userAmount;\n    split[1] = feeAmount;\n    veTokenId = 0; // handle full exit separately\n} else {\n    split = new uint256[](3);\n    split[0] = remainingAmount;\n    split[1] = userAmount;\n    split[2] = feeAmount;\n}\nIVotingEscrow(votingEscrow).multiSplit(veTokenId, split);",
  "proof_of_concept": "```solidity\n// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity 0.8.13;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\n\nimport {C4PoCTestbed} from \"./C4PoCTestbed.t.sol\";\nimport {HybraTimeLibrary} from \"../contracts/libraries/HybraTimeLibrary.sol\";\nimport {GaugeCL} from \"../contracts/CLGauge/GaugeCL.sol\";\nimport {INonfungiblePositionManager} from \"../contracts/CLGauge/interface/INonfungiblePositionManager.sol\";\nimport {Bribe} from \"../contracts/Bribes.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC20/ERC20.sol\";\nimport \"@openzeppelin/contracts/token/ERC721/IERC721Receiver.sol\";\n\n/**\n * @title C4PoC\n * @notice A complete deployment of the CL contract suite\n * @dev All available variables are showcased in the commented\n *      storage slots of the contract.\n */\n\n// Deployed contracts\n// ProxyAdmin public proxyAdmin;\n// PermissionsRegistry public permissionsRegistry;\n// VeArtProxyUpgradeable public veArtProxy;\n// TokenHandler public tokenHandler;\n\n// HYBR public hybr;\n// RewardHYBR public rewardHybr;\n// GrowthHYBR public gHybr;\n// VotingEscrow public votingEscrow;\n\n// GaugeFactory public gaugeFactory;\n// GaugeFactoryCL public gaugeFactoryCL;\n\n// PairFactory public thenaFiFactory;\n\n// GaugeManager public gaugeManager;\n// BribeFactoryV3 public bribeFactoryV3;\n\n// MinterUpgradeable public minter;\n// RewardsDistributor public rewardsDistributor;\n\n// VoterV3 public voter;\n\n// address public deployer;\n\n// Imported contracts\n// address public clPoolFactory;\n// address public clPoolImplementation;\n// address public clNonfungiblePositionManager;\n// address public clNftPositionDescriptor;\n// address public clSwapRouter;\n// address public clQuoter;\n// address public clSwapFeeModule;\n// address public clUnstakedFeeModule;\n// address public clProtocolFeeModule;\n\n// Administrative Addresses\n// address public team = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n// address public poolFactoryOwner = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n// address public feeManager = 0xf39Fd6e51aad88F6F4ce6aB8827279cffFb92266;\n\ninterface ICLFactoryWithManager {\n    function setGaugeManager(address _gaugeManager) external;\n    function createPool(address tokenA, address tokenB, int24 tickSpacing, uint160 sqrtPriceX96)\n        external\n        returns (address pool);\n}\n\ncontract C4PoC is C4PoCTestbed {\n    using stdStorage for StdStorage;\n    function setUp() public override {\n        super.setUp();\n        if (address(bribeFactoryV3.gaugeManager()) == address(0)) {\n            bribeFactoryV3.initialize(\n                address(voter),\n                address(gaugeManager),\n                address(permissionsRegistry),\n                address(tokenHandler)\n            );\n        }\n    }\n\n    function test_submissionValidity() external {}\n\n    function test_GovernanceHYBRWithdrawFullPositionRevertsWithZeroWeight() external {\n        address user = makeAddr(\"withdrawUser\");\n        address feeRecipient = makeAddr(\"feeRecipient\");\n\n        gHybr.setTeam(feeRecipient);\n        votingEscrow.toggleSplit(address(gHybr), true);\n\n        uint256 depositAmount = 1e18;\n        hybr.transfer(user, depositAmount);\n\n        vm.startPrank(user);\n        hybr.approve(address(gHybr), depositAmount);\n        gHybr.deposit(depositAmount, user);\n        vm.stopPrank();\n\n        uint256 warpTarget =\n            block.timestamp\n            + gHybr.transferLockPeriod()\n            + gHybr.head_not_withdraw_time()\n            + 10;\n        vm.warp(warpTarget);\n\n        uint256 epochStart = HybraTimeLibrary.epochStart(block.timestamp);\n        uint256 epochNext = HybraTimeLibrary.epochNext(block.timestamp);\n\n        assertGe(\n            block.timestamp,\n            epochStart + gHybr.head_not_withdraw_time(),\n            \"withdraw window head\"\n        );\n        assertLt(\n            block.timestamp,\n            epochNext - gHybr.tail_not_withdraw_time(),\n            \"withdraw window tail\"\n        );\n\n        uint256 shares = gHybr.balanceOf(user);\n\n        vm.startPrank(user);\n        vm.expectRevert(bytes(\"ZW\"));\n        gHybr.withdraw(shares);\n        vm.stopPrank();\n    }\n\n}",
